# Read by BuildKit for packages/ui/Dockerfile instead of a root .dockerignore.
# The image needs the workspace manifests, the shared lint config, the design
# system and the packages it builds on, and the data set its screens show.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
.git
apps
services
design
docs
e2e
load
packages/met
packages/cache-tags
packages/drops
packages/ui/storybook-static
